<title>SLOVENIA: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MARIBOR, Slovenia 1997-01-04</dateline>
<text>
